{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54372","headline":"赠禅客 · 僧润","name":"赠禅客","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"了妄归真万虑空，河沙凡圣体通同。\n迷来尽似蛾投焰，悟去皆如鹤出笼。\n片月影分千涧水，孤松声任四时风。\n直须密契心心地，休苦劳生睡梦中。\n（见影宋本《景德传灯录》卷二九）（按：《宝林传》爲贞元十七年释智炬作。\n僧润时代在智炬以後。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"僧润","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54372.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54372","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}